    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"statblock npc rules-2024\"><h4 class=\"statblock-title\">死亡化身</h4><p><span class=\"statblock-tags\">中型亡灵，中立邪恶</span></p><div class=\"statblock-header\"><div class=\"half-width\"><p><strong>AC</strong> 20<br /><strong>HP</strong> 其召唤者生命值上限的一半<br /><strong>速度</strong> 60 尺；飞行 60 尺（悬浮）<br /><strong>先攻</strong> +3 (13)</p></div><div class=\"abilities\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\">调整</th><th scope=\"col\">豁免</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">力量</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">智力</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\">调整</th><th scope=\"col\">豁免</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">敏捷</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">感知</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"visually-hidden\"></th><th scope=\"col\">调整</th><th scope=\"col\">豁免</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">体质</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">魅力</th><td class=\"score\">16</td><td>+3</td><td>+3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"half-width\"><p><strong>免疫</strong> 暗蚀，毒素；力竭，恐慌，麻痹，石化，中毒，昏迷<strong><br />感官</strong> 真实视觉 60 尺；被动察觉 13<br /><strong>语言</strong> 所有其召唤者知晓的语言<br /><strong>CR</strong> 无（XP 0；PB 等于其召唤者）</p></div></div><h5 class=\"statblock-actions-title\">特质</h5><p><em><strong>虚体移动。</strong></em>死亡化身可以移动穿过其他生物或物件，如同穿过困难地形一般。在其回合结束时，如果化身还处于物件内，其受到 5（1d10）力场伤害。</p><h5 class=\"statblock-actions-title\">动作</h5><p><em><strong>多重攻击。</strong></em>死亡化身进行数次收割之镰攻击，次数等于召唤者熟练加值的一半（向上取整）。</p><p><em><strong>收割之镰。</strong>近战攻击：</em>自动命中，触及 5 尺。<em>命中：</em>7（1d8 + 3）挥砍伤害外加 4（1d8）暗蚀伤害。</p></div>",
        "public": "<p class=\"actor-original\">Avatar of Death</p>"
      },
